{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch22kgk3zdVjtDT8pfDng", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off on the Tasks.org sweep with moderate confidence (0.55). Two bugs were filed and confirmed by the developer.\n\n**Filed bugs**\n1. **Repeating task, same-day reschedule:** Completing \"Final dose\" (repeats daily, occurs 1 time, due Monday, December 14) shows \"Final dose rescheduled for December 14\". It stays unchecked on the same date. Its editor still shows \"Repeats daily, occurs 1 time\". By comparison, \"Weekly review\" moved correctly from December 14 to December 28.\n2. **Back during search exits the app:** After submitting a search (for example \"tickets\"), one system Back press leaves Tasks.org and shows the launcher. It should return to the My Tasks list. Back works correctly when search is open without a submitted query.\n\n**Checked and working**\n- Pay rent (monthly): December 4 → January 4, 2027 → February 4, 2027. Undo restores the previous date.\n- Water plants (hourly): 10 AM → 11 AM → 12 PM.\n- Subtask badge: 2 → 1 → 0 as subtasks are completed, back to 1 on Undo, and gone once the last subtask is deleted.\n- Search by subtask name, the empty state for no match, and clearing the query.\n- Back from an editor opened via search returns to the search results.\n- Discarding edits keeps the original title.\n- The \"Recently modified\" filter survives opening and leaving an editor.\n- Rotation keeps the list state.\n\n**Not covered**\n- Sort options, the Today filter, reminders, and tapping the link in \"Read docs\" notes.\n\n**Open question, not filed**\n- A subtask I created (\"Check link\") opened with Priority set to Low, while its parent \"Read docs\" has none. I didn't set it, and I couldn't confirm the intended default, so I left it out of the report."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1088, "cache_read_input_tokens": 209569, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1088}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "66d46af1-63c6-4c30-9b54-f58082f8e656", "uuid": "cf70749c-2b64-4980-b0f1-5e9b4f7bc37d", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T02:27:58.521Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch22kgWui3vMHYWPyATyK"}
